<title>JAPAN: Bargain-hunters lift Sony in early trade.</title>
<headline>Bargain-hunters lift Sony in early trade.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bargain-hunting investors lifted Sony Corp shares in early Wednesday morning trade, brokers said, continuing an ascent that started on Tuesday after a period of profit-taking.</p>
<p>As of 0022 GMT, the shares were up 130 yen at 8,910.</p>
</text>
